SQUAD='RR lists Jurel, Hetmyer, Ferreira, Jadeja and Shubham Dubey, plus Archer, Sandeep Sharma and Tushar Deshpande [S1, checked 13 Nov 2026]. Jurel described his move to No. 3 in 2026 [S17]; Samson moved to CSK [S2]. The inference is conditional Indian lower-order depth and reserve Indian death bowling, not a verified vacant starting-XI slot. Existing batting and pace cover could remove either need. The 2026 Curran/Shanaka injury replacement [S3] does not establish their 2027 contract rights.'
