LIMITATIONS=[
 'Pressure is a transparent situation heuristic, not measured psychology or a calibrated win probability. First-innings pressure depends on a scoring par, not a known target.',
 'Ordinary peer outcomes use the full historical window, excluding the current match. They are retrospective adjustment references. Only the pressure state/rate expectations are restricted to pre-ball information and prior years.',
 'The pack is selective, not all world T20 cricket: no competition explicitly named a T20 World Cup appears. International opposition and venues differ from IPL; opponent shrinkage cannot remove every strength effect.',
 'No injury, availability, auction-price, pitch-condition, boundary-size or detailed fielding model is available. Venue IDs exist but granular venue cells would be sparse. No ball-speed or stroke variables enter the model.',
 'Match-block bootstrap holds peer expectations fixed and does not include model-choice, future form or reference-estimation uncertainty. Intervals overlap substantially; exact ordinal ranks near the cutoff are fragile.',
 'Pressure exposure selects particular roles and match states. Many powerplay specialists miss the sample cut. Phase weights are exposure-based, so these are performance-in-observed-role rankings, not equal-phase talent ratings.',
 'All seasons have equal weight. This is a historical reliability study, not a recency-weighted IPL 2027 forecast. Retired players are eligible for historical rankings under the same sample rules. Franchise and retirement findings affect only the separate acquisition research.',
 'Status snapshot: 13 November 2026. All 1,217 supplied IDs were screened against reviewed retirement registers; 274 official roster-history identities and the priority player cohort received deeper source review. This is not an exhaustive individual news search for all players. Unknown statuses remain unresolved. No official IPL 2027 auction entry list was located.',
 'The public Unstop event listing was checked, but player dropdown options were not exposed. Exact source names and IDs are preserved; dropdown eligibility and spelling must be checked manually, including data aliases.',
 'Unstop permits AI assistance but requires the participant to own the final insights; wholly AI-generated submissions may be disqualified [S11]. Review, validate and adapt this analysis before submitting.'
]
